index.html bundles, and assets/ contains, the following third-party software and models.
Each keeps its own license. The Apache-2.0 text is in LICENSE; the other license
texts are at the end of this file.

Engine and models
- WebGPU inference engine for Ternary Bonsai 2 (kernels.ts), ported from the Hugging Face space
  https://huggingface.co/spaces/webml-community/ternary-bonsai-2-webgpu-kernels
  (webml-community / Xenova). The space publishes no license file; it is redistributed here
  under Apache-2.0 on the authority of Prism ML.
- Ternary Bonsai 2 model weights (2B, 4B, 9B; GGUF) by Prism ML, Apache-2.0. Not included:
  they are downloaded at run time from Hugging Face (prism-ml) or the Prism ML mirror.

Speech (assets/voice)
- Whistle speech-to-text model and the needle runtime (needle.js, needle.wasm, whistle.cact)
  by Cactus Compute, Apache-2.0. https://huggingface.co/Cactus-Compute/whistle
  https://github.com/cactus-compute/needle
- Paradee-8M text-to-speech model (paradee-8m.onnx, paradee-config.json) by Sahil Mahendrakar,
  Apache-2.0. https://huggingface.co/sahilmahendrakar/Paradee-8M-v1.0
- Pronunciation lexicon (lexicon.json) and the training data of our letter-to-sound model
  (g2p.bin, g2p.json) from misaki (hexgrad), Apache-2.0 (assets/voice/misaki-LICENSE).
  https://github.com/hexgrad/misaki
- Silero VAD (silero_vad.onnx) by Silero Team, MIT. https://github.com/snakers4/silero-vad
- Smart Turn v3.2 (smart-turn-v3.2-cpu.onnx), Copyright (c) 2024-2025 Daily, BSD-2-Clause.
  https://github.com/pipecat-ai/smart-turn
- ONNX Runtime Web (ort.*.mjs, ort-wasm-simd-threaded.*) by Microsoft Corporation, MIT.
  https://github.com/microsoft/onnxruntime
- Transformers.js (transformers.min.js) by Hugging Face, Apache-2.0
  (assets/voice/transformers-LICENSE). https://github.com/huggingface/transformers.js
- Whisper tiny.en / base.en / small.en (downloaded at run time from onnx-community on
  Hugging Face, not included) by OpenAI, Apache-2.0 (model cards) / MIT (code).

Documents (assets/pdf)
- PDF.js 4.10.38 by Mozilla, Apache-2.0 (assets/pdf/pdfjs-LICENSE). https://github.com/mozilla/pdf.js

Page
